# Files kept in git but left out of the Comfy Registry archive.
# What ComfyUI actually loads is __init__.py, server_routes.py, common/,
# nodes/, data/, requirements.txt and the built frontend/dist bundle.

# Credentials and local state. These are all in .gitignore, so a publish from
# a CI checkout never sees them — but `comfy node publish` run from a working
# copy packs the directory as it stands, and this one has live API keys in it.
# The 2026-07-29 audit found API.env and data/auth.json (3978 bytes of real
# provider keys) sitting outside this list with nothing but "we always publish
# from CI" between them and the registry.
API.env
data/auth.json
data/auth.json.backup-*
# Obsolete but still on some disks; nothing reads it. Keep excluding it so
# `comfy node publish` from a working copy cannot ship a stale cache.
data/provider_vision_smoke.json
# Exact names on purpose: `config.example.yaml` is the template users are told
# to copy, and it has to ship. Do not widen these to `config*.yaml`.
config.yaml
config.local.yaml
comfyui_detail.log
logs/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright.comfy.config.ts

# Test suite and developer tooling. fix.md is the running log of individual
# repairs — written for whoever maintains this pack, not for whoever installs
# it; CHANGELOG.md is the user-facing half. install_requirements.bat stays:
# the README documents it in both language halves.
tests/
tools/
scripts/
requirements-dev.txt
.flake8
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.github/
.claude/
.agents/
.vscode/
CLAUDE.md
fix.md
audit.md
audit-next.md
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Frontend sources — only frontend/dist ships. frontend/public is a
# byte-for-byte duplicate of dist/style-previews, so shipping both doubles
# 1.5 MB of preview images for nothing. The sourcemap goes for the same
# reason: 1.8 MB, and its `sourcesContent` inlines all 164 files that the
# next line excludes. Devtools will 404 on it, which costs nothing to anyone
# who is not debugging the bundle, and anyone who is has the repository.
frontend/dist/fil_design_imagemind.js.map
frontend/src/
frontend/public/
frontend/tests/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/scripts/
frontend/package.json
frontend/package-lock.json
frontend/tsconfig.json
frontend/vite.config.ts
frontend/eslint.config.js
frontend/playwright.config.ts
frontend/index.html
frontend/test-playground.html
frontend/.gitignore

# Documentation and the GitHub Pages site. docs/workflows/*.json stays — those
# are ready-made graphs users load in ComfyUI.
#
# This list is by name, not `docs/`, so a new file here ships unless it is added
# — `docs/add-theme.md` was written and would have gone to the registry. If you
# add a doc that is for whoever maintains this pack rather than whoever installs
# it, add it below and extend `test_comfyignore_keeps_dev_tooling_and_repo_only_docs_out`.
docs/add-theme.md
docs/ETA_GUIDE.md
docs/MODEL_PROMPTING_GUIDE.md
docs/_config.yml
docs/architecture.md
docs/auth.md
docs/getting-started.md
docs/images/
docs/index.html
docs/prompting.md
docs/styles.md
docs/release/
